  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHancock County, Iowa - County Government and Services\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Search\n \n \n \n\n Contact Us\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n About\n \n \n \n\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Employment\n School Districts\n \n \n \n\n Departments\n \n \n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Communications/911\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Engineer\n Environmental Health\n General Assistance\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veteran Services\n Zoning\n \n \n \n\n Resources\n \n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts \n News\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n Drainage\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Driver's License\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Elections\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Meetings & Agendas\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Pay Property Taxes\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Renew Tags\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \nWelcome to Hancock County, Iowa \n \n\nHancock County was established in 1851. It's home to 9 communities and over 10,000 residents. The County is administered by a three-member Board of Supervisors who are elected for four-year terms. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n\n\n\n\n \nLatest News\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n Auditor\n Proposed Amendment to Hancock County Zoning Ordinance no. 3\n Read More \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n Recorder\n RECREATIONAL VEHICLE OWNERS\n Read More \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors\n Hancock County Proposed Budget for FY2025-2026\n Read More \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n Hancock County\n Hancock County - Notice of Proposed Property Tax Levy for FY2026-2027\n Read More \n \n \n \n \n \nAll NewsEmploymentBid NoticesNotifications\n\n\n\n\n \nWhat's Happening\n \n\n \n\n \n\n Monday\n October 19 \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 855 State Street · Garner, IA \nAgenda \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 855 State Street\n Garner, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Board meets every Monday at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Chambers between the Courthouse and the Public Safety Center. Meetings are open to the public. Start time is subject to change.   Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Monday\n October 26 \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 855 State Street · Garner, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 855 State Street\n Garner, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 26, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Board meets every Monday at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Chambers between the Courthouse and the Public Safety Center. Meetings are open to the public. Start time is subject to change.   Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Monday\n November 2 \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 855 State Street · Garner, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 855 State Street\n Garner, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 2, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Board meets every Monday at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Chambers between the Courthouse and the Public Safety Center. Meetings are open to the public. Start time is subject to change.   Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Monday\n November 9 \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 855 State Street · Garner, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 855 State Street\n Garner, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 9, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Board meets every Monday at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Chambers between the Courthouse and the Public Safety Center. Meetings are open to the public. Start time is subject to change.   Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n \n\n View Full Calendar \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n County Courthouse\n 855 State St.\n\n Garner, IA 50438\n\n Contact Us\n \n \n\n Courthouse Hours\n M-F 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n Department Hours